{"3106160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A-Train 9 V5.0 : Japan Train Simulator Ultimate Edition", "steam_appid": 3106160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Notice to customers outside of Japan:</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be aware that there are some content differences between the version of A Train 9 v5 released in your region, and the version released in Japan.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Deep, Interconnected World of Trains and Cities.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A-Train 9 V5.0: Japan Train Simulator Ultimate Edition blends transport simulation, city building, and economic strategy into a single, richly detailed experience. As the president of your own railway company, you’ll lay tracks and roads, build stations, buy trains, manage timetables and steer the growth of tiny villages into bustling cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/98d748769f4bd9540d11287351fcda2f.poster.avif?t=1769556898\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/98d748769f4bd9540d11287351fcda2f.webm?t=1769556898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/98d748769f4bd9540d11287351fcda2f.mp4?t=1769556898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just a highly detailed railroad sim – it’s a living, breathing ecosystem where every train timetable, suburban expansion, and industrial hub contributes to the success of your metropolis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/040ca23b314d1de56b649241f26b81a3.poster.avif?t=1769556898\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/040ca23b314d1de56b649241f26b81a3.webm?t=1769556898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Vision - Town by Town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape a Thriving Transport Network</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay tracks and stations across mountains, coasts, and plains. Decide where and how your network grows, and watch the city develop around it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Ultra Realistic City Simulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage city districts, build infrastructure, and direct urban expansion with powerful tools and 500+ building types. This is a detailed city building sim at its finest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Simulation</strong><br>Balance industry, logistics, and passenger demand while guiding your economy to prosperity. Every rail decision ripples through the city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive the Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a train cab or ride as a passenger to see your network from different perspectives – or pull back to a strategic bird’s-eye view and optimize from above. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Your Creativity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Construction Mode for sandbox building without resource limits, perfect for freeform planning and creative city design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 60 scenarios or create your own challenges with a level editor and Steam Workshop support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.poster.avif?t=1769556898\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.webm?t=1769556898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.mp4?t=1769556898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Very Own Metropolis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the city begins to grow organically around your network, guide and shape it into your personal utopian metropolis.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affect the growth of each district by deciding which buildings to manually construct. Choose from 500 different types!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful landscaping tools to flatten obstacles, redirect rivers or just make the city nice’n hilly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimise the type of trains (97 varieties included!), their top speed and the timetables they run to, for maximum efficiency.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What’s New?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New features include “Switchyards”, “Train Turnstiles”, and “Railway Couplings” for added realism!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/65b652978a44ab48d0e7feb9a502aaee.avif?t=1769556898\" width=600 height=276 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Buy now and start building your transport legacy today.</i></strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Deep, Interconnected World of Trains and Cities.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A-Train 9 V5.0: Japa