ide where and how your network grows, and watch the city develop around it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Ultra Realistic City Simulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage city districts, build infrastructure, and direct urban expansion with powerful tools and 500+ building types. This is a detailed city building sim at its finest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Simulation</strong><br>Balance industry, logistics, and passenger demand while guiding your economy to prosperity. Every rail decision ripples through the city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive the Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a train cab or ride as a passenger to see your network from different perspectives – or pull back to a strategic bird’s-eye view and optimize from above. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Your Creativity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Construction Mode for sandbox building without resource limits, perfect for freeform planning and creative city design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 60 scenarios or create your own challenges with a level editor and Steam Workshop support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.poster.avif?t=1769556898\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.webm?t=1769556898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.mp4?t=1769556898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Very Own Metropolis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the city begins to grow organically around your network, guide and shape it into your personal utopian metropolis.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affect the growth of each district by deciding which buildings to manually construct. Choose from 500 different types!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful landscaping tools to flatten obstacles, redirect rivers or just make the city nice’n hilly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimise the type of trains (97 varieties included!), their top speed and the timetables they run to, for maximum efficiency.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What’s New?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New features include “Switchyards”, “Train Turnstiles”, and “Railway Couplings” for added realism!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/65b652978a44ab48d0e7feb9a502aaee.avif?t=1769556898\" width=600 height=276 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Buy now and start building your transport legacy today.</i></strong></h2>", "short_description": "Build railroads. Construct your city. Master transport economics. A-Train 9 V5.0 Ultimate Edition is a realistic railroad management and urban development sandbox where every choice – from track layout to industry logistics – affects the prosperity of your metropolis.", "supported_languages": "Japanese, English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/5e19dc0680af98daf342db167fcb6c8351801c32/header.jpg?t=1769556898", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/f417ae0dde78ed574a56bf8cddcf11b2e36d137a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769556898", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/f417ae0dde78